<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>How was your order?</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #faf9f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background: #3d2b1f; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #f5e6d3; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #3d2b1f; line-height: 1.7; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; }
    .stars { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 4px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; background: #3d2b1f; color: #f5e6d3 !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; }
    .footer { background: #f5e6d3; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #7a5c45; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🍁 EziHubb</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>How did we do, {{firstName}}?</h2>
      <p>Your order <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong> — including <em>{{productName}}</em> — was recently delivered. We'd love to hear what you think!</p>
      <div class="stars">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
      <p>Reviews help other customers make confident choices and help our makers continue doing what they love.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="{{reviewUrl}}">Write a Review</a>
      <p>It only takes a minute and means so much.</p>
      <p>Warmly,<br /><strong>The EziHubb Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EziHubb. All rights reserved.<br />
      <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color:#7a5c45">Unsubscribe from review reminders</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
